Z||000003||pherder||09-28-2001||11:07 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ray b:<BR><B>on 88's does the front bar fit on the rear of the 88 or do you need to use a 88 rear only bar???<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Funny you should ask this ... I just got back in from checking to see how an 88 front bar would fit on the 88 cradle I have.<P>It won't  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>The mounting points are too far in on the bar and the bar is too wide ... I think it would be into the wheel/tire.<P>Paul<P>------------------<BR>Paul Herder<BR>88 Formula - Artero kit car doner and 350 TPI<BR>86 SE - 3.2 w/440T4 Transaxle<BR>95 GMC - 350 TBI - Factory "Custom"<BR>92 Mazda Protege - Stock<BR>55 Jones - First Edition WIFE- all mods, equipment,updates :D<BR>Sedgwick, KS 67135||||reg||1
